idthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b0fa14c3f2bb6293a21a428cebd7e1d8cc63221e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b0fa14c3f2bb6293a21a428cebd7e1d8cc63221e\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"1440\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bcc51cdbd7e04e0079472d628d8d0506342adc21\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bcc51cdbd7e04e0079472d628d8d0506342adc21\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"1440\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/321b0a18b1b420e852858a8c4dd738629b1ea459\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/321b0a18b1b420e852858a8c4dd738629b1ea459\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"1440\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/747ebc8ef4a57d95976dca38960c6ef62634aa3f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/747ebc8ef4a57d95976dca38960c6ef62634aa3f\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"1440\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/92123c115c439bb9a887d5f2bffe1f07c8eb67be\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/92123c115c439bb9a887d5f2bffe1f07c8eb67be\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"1440\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6c125bc2923b48e92d9637751dac0f5d57dfeccc\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6c125bc2923b48e92d9637751dac0f5d57dfeccc\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"1440\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/85ad2251212bbd0d4d98b6dde629a6080c11b06c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/85ad2251212bbd0d4d98b6dde629a6080c11b06c\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"1440\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e526331f5dcfe360d2089a39ff224fd332eb9e2a\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e526331f5dcfe360d2089a39ff224fd332eb9e2a\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"1440\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4149175a9e61a5ef2a60c9aa93b2078232450401\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4149175a9e61a5ef2a60c9aa93b2078232450401\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"1440\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2599de7fa6781b84c6ff80cceccd21ae6e208c08\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2599de7fa6781b84c6ff80cceccd21ae6e208c08\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"1440\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #0c1014; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-ke-size=\"size16\">중3 자극과 반응 단원에서</span><br><span style=\"color: #0c1014; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-ke-size=\"size16\">후각을 활용한 수업을 진행해보고</span><br><span style=\"color: #0c1014; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-ke-size=\"size16\">아이들의 반응이 귀여워서 함 만들어봤습니다.</span><br><br><span style=\"color: #0c1014; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-ke-size=\"size16\">감각은 취향을 만들고, 중3은 자신만의 취향이 형성되는 바, 저는 아이들에게 취향을 선물해주고 싶었습니다.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #0c1014; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-ke-size=\"size16\">3개씩 8세트, 총 24종의 향을 준비하고</span><br><span style=\"color: #0c1014; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-ke-size=\"size16\">모둠별로 조합을 이동하며 향을 맡고 기록했습니다.</span><br><br><span style=\"color: #0c1014; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-ke-size=\"size16\">학생들은 정확한 향을 추리한 뒤, 떠오르는 기억과 함께 좋아하는 향에는 ○, 싫어하는 향에는 X를 표시했습니다.</span><br><br><span style=\"color: #0c1014; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-ke-size=\"size16\">재미있었던 건 같은 향을 맡아도</span><br><span style=\"color: #0c1014; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-ke-size=\"size16\">아이들이 떠올리는 장면이 전부 달랐다는 점입니다.</span><br><br><span style=\"color: #0c1014; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-ke-size=\"size16\">자신만의 취향을 발견했길 바랍니다.</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\"><a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1pYCut1M5E8t2RfdC1njhh_7Ra9gnTCia4nKwfM-YC5w/edit?tab=t.0\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1pYCut1M5E8t2RfdC1njhh_7Ra9gnTCia4nKwfM-YC5w/edit?tab=t.0</a></span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">학습지는 여기 있구 </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\"><a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"https://www.coupang.com/vp/products/7650717856?itemId=20355789022&amp;vendorItemId=87440057318&amp;q=%ED%9B%84%EA%B0%81%ED%9B%88%EB%A0%A8%2040%EC%A2%85&amp;searchId=e20fc7322427466&amp;sourceType=search&amp;itemsCount=60&amp;searchRank=2&amp;rank=2\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.coupang.com/vp/products/7650717856?itemId=20355789022&amp;vendorItemId=87440057318&amp;q=%ED%9B%84%EA%B0%81%ED%9B%88%EB%A0%A8%2040%EC%A2%85&amp;searchId=e20fc7322427466&amp;sourceType=search&amp;itemsCount=60&amp;searchRank=2&amp;rank=2</a></span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\"> 교구는 이거썼어요!!</span> </span></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"중학교 과학 학습지 - 후각 탐정단 4페이지 압축본\" data-og-description=\"향취로 알아보는 취‘향’ 좋아하는 향에는 ○, 싫어하는 향에는 X를 표시해 보자. 계열과 정확한 향을 추리해봅시다. 이름: 채점: ________/24 조합 실제 번호 계열 선택 정확한 향 근거·떠오른 장\" data-og-host=\"docs.google.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1pYCut1M5E8t2RfdC1njhh_7Ra9gnTCia4nKwfM-YC5w/edit?tab=t.0\" data-og-url=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1pYCut1M5E8t2RfdC1njhh_7Ra9gnTCia4nKwfM-YC5w/edit?tab=t.0&amp;usp=embed_facebook\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/Nh4gW/dJMb9frPKbD/SCOGZkFitfDmR8W0JQW720/img.png?width=1200&amp;height=630&amp;face=0_0_1200_630\"><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1pYCut1M5E8t2RfdC1njhh_7Ra9gnTCia4nKwfM-YC5w/edit?tab=t.0\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1pYCut1M5E8t2RfdC1njhh_7Ra9gnTCia4nKwfM-YC5w/edit?tab=t.0\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/Nh4gW/dJMb9frPKbD/SCOGZkFitfDmR8W0JQW720/img.png?width=1200&amp;height=630&amp;face=0_0_1200_630\" alt=\"\" xxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">중학교 과학 학습지 - 후각 탐정단 4페이지 압축본</p><p class=\"og-desc\">향취로 알아보는 취‘향’ 좋아하는 향에는 ○, 싫어하는 향에는 X를 표시해 보자. 계열과 정확한 향을 추리해봅시다. 이름: 채점: ________/24 조합 실제 번호 계열 선택 정확한 향 근거·떠오른 장</p><p class=\"og-host\">docs.google.com</p></div></a></div><p>학습지는 일일이 향 40종 다 맡아보고, 아이들이 어려워하거나 잘 모를 향은 제외해봤습니다.</p><p>그리고 나름 재미있을 것 같은 조합끼리 뭉쳐봤어요.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">자유롭게 사용해주시되, 수업후기 댓글로 꼭 남겨주시면, 수업연구에 큰 도움됩니다!!</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
